2026-07-20 22:41:52,178 - INFO - Fetched source issue 48137 (CSTEST-709): summary='Knee Planner' description='Surgeons would like a way to interact and review a 3D version of their CORIOGRAPH knee plans prior to surgery. Surgeons are interested in seeing cross-sectional views. \n\nSurgeons may interface directly with this 3D plan or a rep may “run the screen” while a surgeon overlooks. This may happen in the OR as the patient is being prepped, or may happen outside of the OR in the ~10 minutes before surgery starts. \n\nSurgeons and reps expect that any changes made to the plans (position, sizing) will be reflected in intraop, upon entering the planning state.' issueType='Epic' status='Funnel' parent=None
