2026-07-20 22:41:52,189 - INFO - Fetched source issue 48142 (CSTEST-704): summary='CORIOGRAPH: Technical Debt' description='Evaluate CORIOGRAPH software processes and identify and implement efficiency improvements where possible.\n\n\n\n* Update Segaway(HiRes) to automatically move case folders from Image drop to PMP for all case types.\n* Update Segaway to include functionality for image set verification of complete image set and comparison of DICOM header to the protocol.\n* Update InfoVis functionality to display image verification results from Segaway.\n* -Possible inclusion of knee specific updates for InfoVis if not included in SPOP scope.-\n* Upgrade hardware for Segaway, Plexus, and Dendron hybrid servers. (MS4)\n* Plexus and Dendron performance enhancements for creation and parsing of SR documents.\n* Institute process efficiencies to include CI/CD support and increased implementation of\xa0 automated testing.\n* Increase unit test coverage for Segway, Plexus, and Dendron.\n* Tool and Libraries Update' issueType='Epic' status='Funnel' parent=None
