2026-07-20 22:41:52,195 - INFO - Fetched source issue 48145 (CSTEST-701): summary='AI Planning Feature in TKA' description='A feature (AI model) that leverages previously completed CORI case data to inform initial femur/tibia implant positions and sizes in Combined Planning. The idea is that by looking at previous case data (implant type, landmark data, preop gap data, and femur/tibia implant placement plans and sizes), an algorithm can be developed to enable CORI to better predict where a surgeon may want to place the femur and tibia implants when compared to the CORI default algorithms or SPP. \n\nThe expectation is that this feature will be a “second version” of SPP (as in, will be replacing SPP).' issueType='Epic' status='Define' parent=None
