2026-07-20 22:41:52,359 - INFO - Fetched source issue 48187 (CSTEST-594): summary='libTrackerAPI: tracker.cfg specifications have no effect' description='According to libTrackerAPI  (TAPI) documentation (in the docs folder in the code repository), you can add entries to the tracker.cfg file that will allow you to set certain parameters on the camera.  These are read upon initialization and passed from TAPI to the Atracsys SDK.  These do not work, and when they do not work there is no error message returned by the camera that is apparent to the user.  Default values (hard coded in the library) are always used.' issueType='Epic' status='Funnel' parent=None
