2026-07-20 22:41:52,441 - INFO - Fetched source issue 48231 (CSTEST-543): summary='Display 8 box planning view' description='Show both current user and global plans comparison in Planning Tool for a given deformity filter.  Display all 6 boxes of planning view so that surgeon can compare what they plan vs what the globe (or region or country) plans for a given filtered deformity. \n\nAdd an additional box to show average PROMs score for the case filter based on the PROM type and time frame selected in the filter.\n\nAspirational: Would like to identify top 10% of performers to display as the comparator so that surgeons can compare their data against the “top.”' issueType='Epic' status='Backlog.' parent=None
