2026-07-20 22:41:52,484 - INFO - Fetched source issue 48265 (CSTEST-496): summary='Next Gen Program - ORCA 1.0 Release Summary' description='Improvements need to be made to the CORI Surgical System in order to create a flexible platform that allows surgeons to choose workflows from Saw Based Cutting, Handheld Precision Milling, and Robotic Smart Tools with the objective of expanding indications in orthopedics, extremities and sports.\n\nThese improvements include a foundation of features, applications, and hardware that will strengthen CORI’s competitiveness in the market over time and enable future additions to the platform.\n\n* [https://smith-nephew.atlassian.net/browse/CORI-420|https://smith-nephew.atlassian.net/browse/CORI-420|smart-link] will create the foundation to further expand CORI applications, accessories and capabilities\n* [https://smith-nephew.atlassian.net/browse/CORI-500|https://smith-nephew.atlassian.net/browse/CORI-500|smart-link] \n* [https://smith-nephew.atlassian.net/browse/CORI-499|https://smith-nephew.atlassian.net/browse/CORI-499|smart-link]\n* [https://smith-nephew.atlassian.net/browse/CORI-472|https://smith-nephew.atlassian.net/browse/CORI-472|smart-link] \n* [https://smith-nephew.atlassian.net/browse/CORI-501|https://smith-nephew.atlassian.net/browse/CORI-501|smart-link] \n\nThe platform will then need to expand to include additional accessories and indications\n\n* Sports [https://smith-nephew.atlassian.net/browse/CORI-463|https://smith-nephew.atlassian.net/browse/CORI-463|smart-link] \n* Robotic Hip[https://smith-nephew.atlassian.net/browse/CORI-383|https://smith-nephew.atlassian.net/browse/CORI-383|smart-link] [https://smith-nephew.atlassian.net/browse/CORI-379|https://smith-nephew.atlassian.net/browse/CORI-379|smart-link] [https://smith-nephew.atlassian.net/browse/CORI-388|https://smith-nephew.atlassian.net/browse/CORI-388|smart-link] \n* Shoulder and other extremities\n* Robotic Arm [https://smith-nephew.atlassian.net/browse/CORI-411|https://smith-nephew.atlassian.net/browse/CORI-411|smart-link]' issueType='Epic' status='Funnel' parent=None
