2026-07-20 22:41:52,505 - INFO - Fetched source issue 48519 (CSTEST-475): summary='Updates and Improvements from Cumulus V1' description='This ticket is meant to group minor updates and improvements stemming from V1 pilot group feedback and RAR/Rep feedback. Updates will include changes to workflows, charts/graphics, data representation, aesthetics and features related to usability. \n\n* Increased font size across website\n** Early user feedback has pointed out that current fonts are small and hard to read\n* Separate Trends page and filter from case list\n**' issueType='Feature' status='Archive' parent=None
2026-07-20 22:41:52,506 - INFO - Fetched source issue 48276 (CSTEST-474): summary='UKR - Data processing and storage in Cumulus database' description='In looking to support all of S+N’s robotics-assisted indications , Cumulus must have the ability to upload, identify, and store UKR case data.\n\nThe scope of work represented by this ticket assumes the following has been completed:\n\n* Upload of UKR case data from all CORI software versions that have been commercially available and in-use in the field\n* Identification of a case upload as UKR, and identification of the associated Customer and surgeon\n\n\n\nScope of work for this ticket:\n\n* Storage of the data in a way that allows for quick identification and retrieval based on surgeon, customer or case type (UKR)\n\nThis feature will enable early access to valuable UKR data for the AI/ML COE team, and provide a foundation for creation of a customer-facing dashboard in the future.' issueType='Epic' status='Done' parent=None
