2026-07-21 00:03:07,981 - INFO - Fetched source issue 48213 (CSTEST-562): summary='RI.Insights Versioning and Display' description='The MS infrastructure used for Cumulus forces that each service updated has a version of its own. But for verification purposes we need a single version to be annotated to measure the tests runs, issues encountered and versions the issues were fixed in. The test team has to have access to the bill of materials every time a new changes to either of the services are made and deployed.\n\nVersioning will help the team capture the services and their respective versions for a selected run. Versioning for RI. Insights application will be displayed on the footer of the web page with Major and Minor Version e.g. 2.0/ 2.1/ 3.0\n\nAdmin portal will have a detailed BOM and respective versioning. The overarching version will be Major.Minor.Patch. For e.g., 2.1.89 (the last version goes up with every deployment)' issueType='Epic' status='Done' parent=None
