2026-07-21 00:03:08,024 - INFO - Fetched source issue 48251 (CSTEST-519): summary='Make Crosshair UI Consistent' description='TKA and UKA incorporate a guidance for maintaining the proper trajectory when burring post holes for implants and cut guides.   This guidance includes a 2 cross-hair images, floating on a black background.  one cross hair represents the front of the tool, one represents the back.  when they are aligned on the screen it indicates the the tool is held in the proper trajectory to bur the closest post hole. \n\n there is inconsistency in the screen animation when the tool tracker is covered and uncovered.  in the  Uni application the cross-hairs fly in from the edge of the view, a la powerpoint animation.  in the TKA app they suddenly appear.  these should be made consistent.' issueType='Epic' status='Define' parent=None
