2026-07-21 00:03:08,055 - INFO - Fetched source issue 48520 (CSTEST-471): summary='ActiveArm: Manual Pose Control' description='The user should be able to quickly release the joint brakes and move the arm into a desired positioned.\n\nCommonly used positions may include:\n* Extended away from the operative table for placing the sterile drape https://smith-nephew.atlassian.net/browse/CORI-418\n* Above the patients chest in order to be out of the way during registration\n* Close to the surgical site for bone removal' issueType='Feature' status='Funnel' parent=None
