2026-07-21 00:03:08,119 - INFO - Fetched source issue 48557 (CSTEST-370): summary='Connected CORI: Connectivity Data Ingress' description='Connect the CORI Platform to the cloud to enable better end-to-end care, reduce maintenance cost, and provide best in class product support in a secure manner.\n\nWireless installation of software updates, IDBs, and enabling of procedures\n\n+*CORI Data In*+\n\n* *Software Updates*\n** CORI application, IDB, Language Pack, new features and bug fixes\n* *Pre-Planning*\n** User configuration for implant placements (SDIP), FAI plans, Shoulder Plans\n\n!image-20220314-171744.png|width=391,height=439!' issueType='Feature' status='Funnel' parent=None
