2026-07-21 22:34:21,781 - INFO - Fetched source issue 48488 (CSTEST-632): summary='Engineer/surgeon Notes' description="Surgeon communication with Visionaire Engineer will follow Visionaire’s existing communication channels such as email, or calls outside of the Web Planner.\n\n*Notes:*\n\nNote’s section in the Web Planner is only used as some notes necessary for review of the plan or helpful during intraoperatively.\n\n# Engineer’s notes section could be utilized to draw surgeon's attention for any specific aspect of the plan.\n## Notes can be imported with plan if notes are part of the plan (VOLT/VCM)\n## Surgeon can read but not edit Engineer’s notes\n# Surgeon’s notes section could be used for any reminders during intraoperative execution. This could also be used for any minor notes for engineer.\n## Only Surgeon user able to write/edit it on the Web planner.\n## Notes can be exported from Web planner and viewed by engineer (VOLT/VCM).\n\nSince access to Web planner is controlled by VCM, any user VCM allows to access the web planner, will act as surgeon.\n\n{color:#ff5630}Action to discuss further: Can Web planner even determine the difference between users? Only user name and ID provide by VCM as per current discussions.{color}" issueType='Feature' status='Done' parent=None
