2026-07-21 22:34:21,838 - INFO - Fetched source issue 48259 (CSTEST-503): summary='RIOS Initial SDK' description='This project will include the initial RI.OS SDK release, which will introduce the RI.OS based componentized framework that will enable the migration to a long-term RI.OS platform. Introducing the RI.OS components that will be integrated with existing software in a hybrid approach will \xa0ease migration of all CORI software applications to the RI.OS platform in the long run.\xa0\xa0 In addition to Surgeon Preferential Planning, the TKA states of free collection, combined planning, gap assessment (pre-op and post-op), and case review will be updated to leverage the RI.OS components in a hybrid solution.\xa0\xa0 The function and end user experience for these states will not change; changes will be made just to the underlying implementation.\xa0\xa0 This initial RIOS SDK release will also enable new applications such as FAI and Shoulder to be constructed in a manner that will support long term RIOS' issueType='Epic' status='Done' parent=None
