2026-07-21 22:34:21,878 - INFO - Fetched source issue 48296 (CSTEST-432): summary='IDB Process Verifier and Creator' description='Potential IDB Verifier Process Improvements:\n\n* Add measurement tools to measure the key distances of the implants (e.g., click the edges and the software provides the measured distances between the points)\n* Orthogonal views selector in IDB Verify to quickly and repeatedly rotate views\n* Ability to section view on IDB Verify, particularly for step "Workpiece Without Waste" and "Workpiece"\n* Make IDB Verify not in a random order\n* Make IDB Verify process/user “blinded”, then compare measured values to intended values.\n\n\n\nPotential IDB Creator Process Improvements:\n\n* Fix articulation mesh errors to make the process less sensitive to stl inputs' issueType='Epic' status='Funnel' parent=None
