2026-07-21 22:34:21,928 - INFO - Fetched source issue 48362 (CSTEST-205): summary='Smart Gap Planning for TKA workflow' description='Implement the following features for smart gap assessment\n\nTensioner Case Creation and Upgrades - See [https://smith-nephew.atlassian.net/browse/OPTIMUS-1473|https://smith-nephew.atlassian.net/browse/OPTIMUS-1473|smart-link]\n\nUpdate Surgery Options to mandate collection of joint laxity - See [https://smith-nephew.atlassian.net/browse/OPTIMUS-1474|https://smith-nephew.atlassian.net/browse/OPTIMUS-1474|smart-link]\n\nEnhancements to Joint Laxity Collection (Manual) - See [https://smith-nephew.atlassian.net/browse/OPTIMUS-1475|https://smith-nephew.atlassian.net/browse/OPTIMUS-1475|smart-link]\n\nEnhancements to Joint Laxity Collection - See [https://smith-nephew.atlassian.net/browse/OPTIMUS-1476|https://smith-nephew.atlassian.net/browse/OPTIMUS-1476|smart-link]\n\nEnhancements to Combined Planning (with gaps)  - See [https://smith-nephew.atlassian.net/browse/OPTIMUS-1477|https://smith-nephew.atlassian.net/browse/OPTIMUS-1477|smart-link]\n\nEnhancements to Post-op Gap Assessment (Manual) - See [https://smith-nephew.atlassian.net/browse/OPTIMUS-1480|https://smith-nephew.atlassian.net/browse/OPTIMUS-1480|smart-link]\n\nImplement Post-op Gap Assessment - See [https://smith-nephew.atlassian.net/browse/OPTIMUS-1481|https://smith-nephew.atlassian.net/browse/OPTIMUS-1481|smart-link]' issueType='Epic' status='Archive' parent=None
